  python3 scripts/session-union.py --since 2026-08-09 --until 2026-08-23\n  python3 scripts/session-union.py --include-local --json > /tmp/sessions.json\n  python3 scripts/session-union.py --snap-dir /tmp/my-snap --project tripn-astro\nWHAT-NOT-TESTED: this run had live schema shape (main DB with session+session_v2 45-migration, fork DB with only session, identical ASES project id b826eb8e..., plus local DB) but did NOT have controlled synthetic session fixtures covering every edge (e.g., same id with divergent titles across stores, NULL vs empty title, pre-migration-only session table, missing sidecars, or permission-denied snapshots) — dedupe tie-breaking and schema-fallback branches were exercised only against the natural overlap of the 704 migrated rows (session vs session_v2) and live timestamps, not against hand-crafted divergence cases; viewer behavior inside opencode2 and fork binary db-path derivation were not tested beyond the schema ground truth in #419.","created_at":"2026-08-23T20:24:24.108431159Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:TWdHcGiTJCY3PLH38ClCgH+k9+kdeSDnn79ZFFuUGfs","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgpC9LEuzQJ7mpEm4ig+2ehPbpSmzX5YAo/clFDjIu4qkAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAn1mE+9LuIc7Gnjw4FzF/AjrqSWmgjayJNeji1KxfJkbdDaCe9ixzlK/H4amj/tUS6QEEFdbAudRPA5iCxgKzAw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:TWdHcGiTJCY3PLH38ClCgH+k9+kdeSDnn79ZFFuUGfs","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgpC9LEuzQJ7mpEm4ig+2ehPbpSmzX5YAo/clFDjIu4qkAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEl6xMEO6WsThWcCJR5gPe8AnFuHs0ev2z6R30MtA8fDLLMFe/1OiZiwXXTtWXIVtBa9xOLj+UsodF/GS4JvCQA="}
